<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβλέπω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ψομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cri.</u>
					53b
				</span></i>
			:—<i>look up from under</i> the brows <i>at, look
				askance at, eye suspiciously</i> or <i>angrily</i> (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδρα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				153.2
			</span></i> (hex.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				519
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				396
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. αὐτὸν ὡς καταφρονοῦντα σφῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					220b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβλέψονταί σε διαφθορέα
				ἡγούμενοι</span> Id.<u>Cri.</u> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Symp.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Syr.</u>
				45
			</span></i>; also, <i>cast stolen looks at,</i> of lovers, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.521b
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβλεπώμεθ᾽ ὡς ἐγνωσμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					1287
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
				<i>menacing</i> looks, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειλητικόν τι ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινόν τι καὶ θηριῶδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Am.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταυρηδὸν ὑ. πρὸς τὸν ἄνδρα</span>”
				<i>look mischievously,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					117b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἐλεεινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.199
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸν βάρβαρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
				</span></i>
			 Jun.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Im.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>look with the eyes half open, blink,</i> of persons half
			asleep, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Insomn.</u>
				462a22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				958a21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>look under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τοῖς ληΐοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.994c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
